stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> VerifySocket
  VerifySocket --> Authorize: path owner mode inode verified
  Authorize --> Capabilities: auth if required
  Capabilities --> Identify: required v2 methods
  Identify --> Ready: stable app version >= 0.64.20
  Ready --> Request: serialized RPC
  Ready --> EventHint: separate events stream
  EventHint --> Reconcile: gap boot change or close hint
  Reconcile --> Ready: exact system.tree only
  Request --> Ready: valid response
  Request --> FailedClosed: protocol error or unknown mutation
  Ready --> VerifySocket: disconnect then fresh read-only probe
  VerifySocket --> FailedClosed: generation or identity mismatch
  FailedClosed --> Recovery: retain residual metadata when needed
  Recovery --> [*]
